WEBVTT

00:06.640 --> 00:08.040
Minister Tang

00:08.200 --> 00:09.800
What should we do now?

00:09.880 --> 00:11.280
Yes, yes

00:11.560 --> 00:12.600
Your Majesty

00:12.680 --> 00:14.400
Chu Meng is incompetent

00:14.800 --> 00:16.120
He spent months

00:16.200 --> 00:18.320
And still hasn't managed the Beishuo Army

00:18.400 --> 00:21.240
The soldiers in the army simply don't obey his orders

00:21.320 --> 00:22.000
So that

00:22.160 --> 00:24.440
In battles with the rebels, we've suffered repeated defeats

00:24.600 --> 00:25.200
Your servant

00:25.280 --> 00:26.800
Requests Chu Meng's execution

00:28.720 --> 00:30.000
Your Majesty's safety is paramount

00:30.120 --> 00:31.320
Why not leave the city temporarily

00:31.440 --> 00:32.840
Incompetent

00:33.000 --> 00:34.400
What should we do?
